+ * adev->keep_vram_pid. Unlike amdgpu_ttm_evict_resources() (which uses
+ * ttm_resource_manager_evict_all() -> ttm_bo_evict_first() and bypasses
+ * eviction_valuable), this walk honors the keep_vram_pid protection so that
+ * "echo <pid> > keep_vram_pid" leaves <pid> resident while pushing
+ * background buffers out.
